OL,3,ATrump reveals millions of dollars'
OL,4,Aworth of share deals in big tech and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has disclosed
OL,7,Fmillions of dollars' worth of stock
OL,8,Fmarket trades made during July,
OL,9,Fincluding in firms from Elon Musk's
OL,10,FSpaceX to tech and AI giants such as
OL,11,FMicrosoft.
OL,13,FAccording to official documents,
OL,14,Fbetween $6.5m (#4.8m) and $31m worth of
OL,15,Fstock in Microsoft was sold on behalf
OL,16,Fof Trump, while they show purchases of
OL,17,Fbetween $165,000 and $400,000.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
