OL,3,ATrump reveals millions of dollars'
OL,4,Aworth of share deals in big tech and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcross more than 1,000 trades, shares
OL,7,Fwere bought and sold in AI company
OL,8,FNvidia and software firm Palantir, a
OL,9,Fcontractor with the US defence
OL,10,Fdepartment and Immigration and Customs
OL,11,FEnforcement (ICE), the filing shows.
OL,13,FA White House spokesperson said Trump's
OL,14,Fstock and bond portfolio is
OL,15,Findependently managed by third parties.
